Project Prometheus has served as an ongoing experimentation platform for testing architectural patterns, decision\-making models, system interactions, and AI\-driven workflows.

Through iterative development cycles, concepts are evaluated, refined, redesigned, or discarded based on observed outcomes.

This process mirrors the prototyping methodology frequently employed during game systems development, where concepts are validated before full\-scale implementation.

Most people hear:

Prototype

and think:

Unity demo.

Wrong.

A prototype is:

A reduced implementation used to validate an idea.

Prometheus is literally that.

I have been building:

AI behaviors
decision frameworks
architecture concepts
software systems

to test whether ideas work.
